    "updated_at": "2016-03-02T20:41:04Z",
    "body": "OK, after this change \"cloneable objects\" is kind of a lie. \"Cloneable objects support being cloned across event loops\" except when they instead unconditionally throw a DataCloneError. That's not great. Not sure what the solution is though, if any.\n",
